Taxonomy and documentation
==========================

Original pattern definitions, controlled vocabularies, documentation, and
annotation guidance in this repository are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0).

Licence summary:

- You may share and adapt the material for any purpose.
- You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the licence, and indicate
