The authoritative licence text is available at:

https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Attribution should identify "lit_pattern", the source file or document, and the
pattern or schema version used. If the repository owner later selects a
different licence, that decision must be recorded in `REPO_CONTRACT.md` and
`CHANGELOG.md`.

